---
import Icon from '@components/Icon.astro';
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'June 4, 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Zaratuk"
  description="Privacy policy for Zaratuk websites, Power BI custom visuals, connectors, downloads, and related support communications."
>
  <section class="bg-white py-16 sm:py-20">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-forest-700">
        <Icon name="privacy" class="h-4 w-4" />
        Privacy Policy
      </p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950 sm:text-6xl">
        Zaratuk Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">
        Last updated: {lastUpdated}
      </p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-600">
        This policy explains how Zaratuk collects, uses, and protects information when you visit this website, download Zaratuk products, contact us, or use Zaratuk Power BI custom visuals and connectors.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-rule bg-slate-50 py-14">
    <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-4xl gap-8 px-4 text-base leading-8 text-slate-700 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="target" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Scope
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          This policy applies to Zaratuk websites, downloadable Power BI custom visuals, downloadable Power BI custom connectors, product documentation, and support communications. It does not apply to Microsoft Power BI, Microsoft AppSource, Microsoft Fabric, or other third-party products that you may use with Zaratuk products.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="products" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Power BI custom visuals
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Zaratuk Power BI custom visuals are designed to run inside the Power BI environment where you install them. Unless a specific product page says otherwise, Zaratuk custom visuals process the report data that you bind to the visual locally within Power BI and do not send report data, model data, field values, user-entered scenario values, or visual configuration values to Zaratuk servers.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Zaratuk custom visuals do not require a Zaratuk account, do not use a Zaratuk backend for normal visual operation, and do not perform writeback to your systems unless a future product explicitly documents that behavior.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="api" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Power BI custom connectors
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Zaratuk custom connectors may connect to third-party APIs that you choose to configure, such as an analytics, AI, or operational system API. In those cases, the connector sends requests from your Power BI environment to the provider you configure and returns data to Power BI. Zaratuk does not receive that provider data unless you separately send it to us for support.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Credentials and authentication for those providers are handled through Power BI and the provider's authentication flow. You should review the privacy and security terms of any provider you connect to Power BI.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="download" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Website and download information
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          When you visit this website, hosting and security providers may process standard request information such as IP address, browser type, user agent, referrer, requested URL, timestamps, and basic diagnostic logs.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          The website may use Cloudflare Pages Analytics or similar infrastructure analytics to measure site traffic, performance, and aggregate usage patterns.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          When you download a Zaratuk package, the website may record aggregate download counts by product and date. It may also record limited download event metadata such as product name, download path, referrer, and user agent to understand product usage and troubleshoot delivery issues.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          This website does not intentionally set advertising cookies or sell visitor information. It may load fonts or other static assets from third-party infrastructure, which can cause your browser to make requests to those providers.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="contact" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Information you provide
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          If you email Zaratuk, submit the contact form, or request support, we may receive your name, email address, organization, message content, attachments, screenshots, sample data, report details, or other information you choose to provide. Please avoid sending confidential production data unless it is necessary and you are authorized to share it.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="settings" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          How information is used
        </h2>
        <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
          <li>To operate, secure, and improve the website and downloads.</li>
          <li>To respond to questions, support requests, and product feedback.</li>
          <li>To diagnose issues with Zaratuk visuals, connectors, documentation, or downloads.</li>
          <li>To understand product interest using aggregate download information.</li>
          <li>To comply with legal, security, or marketplace requirements.</li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="storefront" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Sharing and service providers
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Zaratuk may use service providers for website hosting, security, email, source control, deployment, and product distribution. These providers process information only as needed to provide those services. Zaratuk does not sell personal information.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          If you install or obtain a Zaratuk product through Microsoft AppSource, Power BI, GitHub, or another marketplace or platform, that platform may process information under its own privacy terms.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="schedule" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Retention
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Zaratuk keeps support communications for as long as needed to respond, maintain business records, and improve products. Aggregate download counts may be retained for product analytics. Hosting logs and security logs are retained according to the practices of the relevant infrastructure providers.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="privacy" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Security
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Zaratuk uses reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information. No website, software package, or internet transmission can be guaranteed to be completely secure, so you should use care when deciding what information to share.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="check" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Your choices
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          You can choose not to provide personal information by not contacting Zaratuk directly. If you want to request access, correction, or deletion of information you have provided to Zaratuk, contact us at <a class="font-semibold text-forest-950 underline decoration-powerbi-500 decoration-2 underline-offset-4" href="mailto:info@zaratuk.ca">info@zaratuk.ca</a>.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="privacy" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Children's privacy
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Zaratuk products and this website are intended for professional and business use. They are not directed to children.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-white p-6 shadow-line">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal text-forest-950">
          <Icon name="article" class="h-5 w-5 text-forest-700" />
          Changes to this policy
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Zaratuk may update this policy from time to time. When updates are made, the date at the top of this page will be changed.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article class="rounded-lg border border-black/10 bg-forest-950 p-6 text-white">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-3 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-normal">
          <Icon name="contact" class="h-5 w-5 text-powerbi-500" />
          Contact
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-white/75">
          Questions about this privacy policy can be sent to <a class="font-semibold text-powerbi-500 underline decoration-powerbi-500 decoration-2 underline-offset-4" href="mailto:info@zaratuk.ca">info@zaratuk.ca</a>.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
